<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  The always-available chat model: a durable shared gateway holding the phone-chat
  model (Qwen3.5-4B) resident on :8089, so the UCC chat (/chat.html -> coder/launch ->
  `rozum launch`) reuses it instead of cold-loading a fresh gateway per message.

  Auto-sleep on idle (the operator's chosen RAM policy): the watchdog UNLOADS the model
  after 5 min idle — freeing ~7.4 GiB, on the ledger as well as in RAM — while KEEPING the
  daemon alive; the next chat message lazily reloads it in ~1.1 s.

  That 5 min is NOT set here. This file used to pin ROZUM_GATEWAY_UNLOAD_IDLE_SECS=1200
  while the code's default said 900, so the documented policy and the compiled one disagreed
  and only the installed plist decided anything — the same "two copies, one goes stale" that
  cost this repo a three-days-behind binary (see the Binary note below). The number lives in
  `switchboard::unload_idle_secs` now; set the env var here only to deviate from it. It is a MANUAL
  gateway (ROZUM_GATEWAY_LAUNCH_MANAGED deliberately NOT set), so it survives the
  lease gaps between one-shot `claude -p` agents instead of self-exiting on
  "clients_gone" — only idle-unload and preemption move it.

  Reboot-safe: at boot `acquire_residency` WAITS (ROZUM_GATEWAY_RESIDENCY_WAIT_SECS,
  default 240s) for host RAM/pressure to clear before loading, so it never forces a
  load into a jetsam-pressure host (the no-reboot invariant, BUG-003). If the wait
  times out it exits and KeepAlive retries — self-healing, never a crash-loop that
  overcommits.

  Binary: ~/.cargo/bin/rozum-gateway — the ONE copy, which every other job here already execs.
  It used to be a second copy at ~/.rozum/bin/rozum-gateway, "the deploy-managed stable copy",
  and on 2026-08-08 that copy was found three days behind: hand installs went to ~/.cargo/bin,
  this service ran the other file, and nothing said so. Two files that must be identical are two
  files that will not be. `scripts/install-bins.sh` publishes to every path this roster names, so
  a future second copy would be kept in step — but not having one is better.
  Install: `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID <this>` after copying it to ~/Library/LaunchAgents/.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.rozum.gateway</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/Users/sergiy/.cargo/bin/rozum-gateway</string>
    <string>gateway</string>
    <string>--model</string>
    <string>mlx-community:Qwen3.5-4B-MLX-4bit</string>
    <string>--n-ctx</string>
    <string>32768</string>
    <string>--port</string>
    <string>8089</string>
  </array>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>HOME</key><string>/Users/sergiy</string>
    <key>PATH</key><string>/Users/sergiy/.cargo/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
  </dict>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key><string>/Users/sergiy/work/my/rozum</string>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>
  <key>KeepAlive</key><true/>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/sergiy/.rozum-gateway.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/sergiy/.rozum-gateway.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
